      "domain": "auxiliary"
    }
  ],
  "operating_conditions": [
    "Alternative A (TI): eFuse OVP 15 V, UVLO 9 V, 2.2 A. Alternative B (Wolfspeed): P-FET reverse protection with 20 V Zener clamp."
